  "bio": "Edgar Rodriguez is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in illustrative, black & gray, and fine line styles. Operating out of Dallas, United States, and widely respected for his professionalism, clients can expect a meticulous and efficient tattooing experience. To book an appointment with Edgar, who works at Botoku Tattoo Studio in Colorado Springs, CO, clients are encouraged to email, avoiding direct messages, or to click the scheduling link provided in his descriptions.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Dallas, Texas, United States\n\n• 7+ years | Custom Tattoo Designs\n• Neo-Traditional & Illustrative\n• Booking April-May @blackdahlia719\n• DM or Email your idea + placement",
